  Nodes:
  - NodeID: Start
    SpeakerName: Hung (Mechanic)
    Text: You know, these new bikes are all plastic and sensors. One drop and they're
      broken.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 1
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 1
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: Unlike mine, which is already broken but keeps moving.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 2
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 2
    SpeakerName: Hung (Mechanic)
    Text: Exactly! This is real engineering. Metal and grit!
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 3
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 3
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: "I\u2019d prefer a little less grit and a little more speed, honestly."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 4
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 4
    SpeakerName: Hung (Mechanic)
    Text: Patience is a virtue, kid. Enjoy the slow ride!
    Choices: []
